21
00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:20.040
Tohutu ettevaatust.
Ma lõin natuke veel pea.

22
00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.560
Niimoodi.

23
00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:22.920
Tervist.

24
00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.140
Tervist.

25
